==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|fornicātus}}, perfect passive participle to {{m|en|fornicor}}, from {{m|la|fornix||arch, vault; brothel}}. It was customary for courtesans of the era to wait for their customers out of the rain in arched passageways.

