* {{a|GA}}, {{IPA|/ˈfɔɹ.nɪ.kət/|lang=en}}
; Verb
* {{a|RP}}, {{IPA|/ˈfɔː.nɪˌkeɪt/|lang=en}}
* {{a|GA}}, {{IPA|/ˈfɔɹ.nɪˌkeɪt/|lang=en}}

